      "id": "claim_d5d2c884f05e48659e2047c261720386",
      "statement": "The async get_agent(config) factory in agent/server.py compiles the primary coding agent per executable thread run by resolving its sandbox, model policy, tool surface, subagent, skills, and middleware before calling create_deep_agent.",
